  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EUCAP Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CD/2012/389/CFSP and its amendmentsThe Mission was launched in July 2012 as EUCAP NESTOR to support countries in the Horn of Africa to develop maritime security. In December 2016, the Council of the European Union decided that the Mission will focus only on Somalia, including Somaliland, and subsequently it was renamed to EUCAP Somalia. In December 2022, the Council of European Union extended the Mission&#xbf;s mandate for another two years (2023-2024).</narrative>
  </description>
